{
    "title": "Trivia Master - Word Quiz Game",
    "description": "A newly designed general knowledge trivia quiz game!\r\n\r\nTrain your brain with 50000+ interesting and popular questions.\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re a fan of free, relaxing offline games, including trivia, quiz, puzzle games or even the classic card games, give the trivia master game a try!\r\n\r\nDo you have vast trivia knowledge? Play games against family, friends and other players to win! Show you know the most trivia by answering questions in different categories like nature, sports, science, film, music and geography. \r\n\r\nBecome the master of trivia by learning fun and interesting facts!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES:\r\n- 50000+ trivia questions\r\n- Different categories\r\n- Different difficulties\r\n- Test your IQ and general knowledge\r\n- Fluent game play and pleasant interfaces\r\n- Support both phones and tablets\r\n- Learn and relax your mind\r\n- Become a trivia master\r\n\r\nCompete with your friends to win millions! In order to win, you need to really turn on your intellect and be lucky.\r\n\r\nEnjoy it!",
    "descriptionHTML": "A newly designed general knowledge trivia quiz game!<br><br>Train your brain with 50000+ interesting and popular questions.<br><br>If you\u2019re a fan of free, relaxing offline games, including trivia, quiz, puzzle games or even the classic card games, give the trivia master game a try!<br><br>Do you have vast trivia knowledge? Play games against family, friends and other players to win! Show you know the most trivia by answering questions in different categories like nature, sports, science, film, music and geography. <br><br>Become the master of trivia by learning fun and interesting facts!<br><br>GAME FEATURES:<br>- 50000+ trivia questions<br>- Different categories<br>- Different difficulties<br>- Test your IQ and general knowledge<br>- Fluent game play and pleasant interfaces<br>- Support both phones and tablets<br>- Learn and relax your mind<br>- Become a trivia master<br><br>Compete with your friends to win millions! In order to win, you need to really turn on your intellect and be lucky.<br><br>Enjoy it!",
